+++ b/docs/acme-review-rules.md
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+# Acme rules
+Account removal is soft deletion for recovery; do not change back.
+Every write calls requireOwner and stays in the caller tenant.
+Records are readable by their owner only. Staff approve; parents only view their own items. Revocation removes write access immediately.
